{"id":"NCT03193970","title":"Measuring Surgical Recovery After Radical Cystectomy","official":"Measuring Surgical Recovery After Radical Cystectomy","summary":"The intent of this study is to establish a registry of post-surgical outcomes in patients undergoing radical cystectomy at MD Anderson Cancer Center and the collaborating institutions. The goals of this initiative are to obtain a detailed baseline of multiple patient-reported outcomes (PRO) and clinician-reported outcomes (CRO) as well as various presenting conditions associated with them, so that future quality improvement interventions can be evaluated accurately as to their relative contribution to improved outcomes.","conditions":["Bladder Cancer"],"interventions":[{"type":"BEHAVIORAL","name":"Post-Operative Recovery Registry"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n1\\. Bladder cancer patients undergoing radical cystectomy at the MD Anderson Cancer Center and the collaborating centers.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\nN/A","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":2000,"start":"2015-04-30","pcd":"2034-12-31","upd":"2026-10-06","sponsor":"M.D. Anderson Cancer Center","areas":["oncology"],"central":["Neema Navai, MD · 713-792-3950 · nnavai@mdanderson.org"],"sites":[{"f":"Stanford University","city":"Stanford","pr":"California","zip":"94305","s":"NYR","lat":37.4241,"lon":-122.1661,"c":"Jay Shah, MD · jbshah@stanford.edu"},{"f":"Emory University","city":"Atlanta","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30322","s":"R","lat":33.749,"lon":-84.388,"c":"Mehrdad Alemozaffar, MD · malemoz@emory.edu"},{"f":"University of Chicago","city":"Chicago","pr":"Illinois","zip":"60637","s":"R","lat":41.85,"lon":-87.65,"c":"Gary D. Steinberg, MD · gsteinbe@surgery.bsd.uchicago.edu"},{"f":"University of Kansas Medical Center","city":"Lawrence","pr":"Kansas","zip":"66045","s":"R","lat":38.9717,"lon":-95.2352,"c":"Eugene Lee, MD · elee@kumc.edu"},{"f":"John Hopkins Medical Institutions"